@startuml senku-ingestion-flush
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
top to bottom direction

title Senku Ingestion and Sharded Flush Directories

actor "Concurrent callers" as Callers
component "SenkuIngestor\n\nHashMap<K,V>\none ReentrantLock\nexact map size" as Ingestor
component "Stop-the-world flush\nwhile holding the lock\n\n1. count records per shard\n2. place map-entry references in shard ranges\n3. sort each shard range by key\n4. record shard ID, start, and record count\n5. publish manifest.properties last\n6. clear map and unlock" as Flush

frame "Committed staging directories" {
  folder "flush/flush-00001/\n\nmanifest.properties\nshard-index.dat\npart-00000.chunk\npart-00001.chunk\n\nscarce shard-start index [m]\nS000: shard ID, start, record count\nS001: shard ID, start, record count\n..." as Flush1
  folder "flush/flush-K/\n\nmanifest.properties\nshard-index.dat\npart-00000.chunk\n\nlater generation\ndifferent record counts" as FlushK
}

Callers --> Ingestor : put\nlock; get; optional merge; put
Ingestor --> Flush : map limit reached
Flush --> Flush1 : flush generation 1
Flush --> FlushK : later generation

note bottom of Flush1
The shard count and shardFor(key) are fixed.
A logical generation may span ordered parts.
Each part is a ChunkStoreFile of compressed pages.
LargeFile composes parts without changing ChunkStoreFile.
Shard starts are opaque LargeFilePosition tokens; no page ID is exposed.
High position bits select the part; low 31 bits hold
the existing local CellPosition.
Parts rotate before a page would exceed maxEntriesPerPart.
This entry limit does not guarantee a physical byte limit.
end note
@enduml
